{"seq":2,"slug":"false-positive-appeal","title":"误杀申诉与白名单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/evidence-appeal-report/false-positive-appeal","wordCount":4407,"readingTime":18,"html":"<h1 id=\"误杀申诉与白名单\">误杀申诉与白名单</h1><p>过滤系统的每一个阈值都在做一个权衡：往紧调一点，误杀上升；往松调一点，漏放上升。漏放会被监管发现，误杀会被卖家发现——而卖家的反应比监管快得多，他们会在几分钟内提交申诉、在社群里抱怨、并把商品搬到别的渠道。因此误杀申诉不是合规系统的附属功能，它同时承担三个角色：用户救济通道、误杀率的测量仪表、以及规则改进的数据来源。把申诉做成一个「收到即人工处理」的队列，等于同时放弃了后两个角色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-申诉是三种信息的汇聚点\">核心概念：申诉是三种信息的汇聚点</h2><p>一条申诉至少携带三类信息：<strong>定位信息</strong>（针对的是哪一次判定，<code>decision_id</code> 或目标 + 时间）、<strong>争议主张</strong>（认为判定错在哪里，必须结构化而不是自由文本）、<strong>证明材料</strong>（许可证扫描件、原文截图、修改后的内容）。</p>\n<p>定位信息决定了申诉表单必须支持「从判定通知里一键申诉」——要求用户自己描述「哪天哪条商品被下架」会引入大量无法定位的申诉，处理成本成倍上升。判定通知里的解释文本由 <a href=\"decision-evidence-chain\">过滤判定证据链</a> 定义的模板生成，因此「一键申诉」能够携带 <code>decision_id</code>。结构化争议主张的价值在于它让「误杀的根因是什么」可以被统计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>争议类型</th>\n<th>申诉人主张</th>\n<th>判定错在哪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品类判定错</td>\n<td>不属于该品类</td>\n<td>品类映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资质未识别</td>\n<td>资质存在但未被识别</td>\n<td>数据同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文案不构成宣称</td>\n<td>文案不构成该宣称</td>\n<td>语义判定过宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辖区不适用</td>\n<td>该辖区规则不适用</td>\n<td>作用域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容已修改</td>\n<td>判定针对的是旧版本</td>\n<td>时效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复发布</td>\n<td>不是我发的</td>\n<td>归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>证明材料这部分不能直接进判定链路——它是外部输入，必须按不可信数据处理，且涉及个人信息时需要最小化与访问控制；它的用途是给人看，而不是给模型看。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申诉工单的状态机\">申诉工单的状态机</h3><p>状态机的价值在于两个「必须经过」的约束：所有非补件终止的路径都必须经过 <code>ROOT_CAUSE_FILED</code>（保证每条处理过的申诉都留下根因记录），以及 <code>OVERTURNED</code> 不能直接到 <code>CLOSED</code>（保证撤销动作必然触发一次规则侧的回看）。这两条如果靠流程规范约束，实际执行中一定会被跳过。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; RECEIVED&#10;  RECEIVED --&gt; NEEDS_INFO: 无法定位判定&#10;  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; RECEIVED: 申诉人补充信息&#10;  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; CLOSED: 超过补件期限&#10;  RECEIVED --&gt; TRIAGED: 定位成功 + 归类完成&#10;  TRIAGED --&gt; AUTO_RESOLVED: 可自动判定者&#10;  TRIAGED --&gt; QUEUED_MANUAL: 需语义判断&#10;  QUEUED_MANUAL --&gt; REVIEWING: 复核员领取&#10;  REVIEWING --&gt; UPHELD: 判定正确, 维持&#10;  REVIEWING --&gt; OVERTURNED: 判定有误, 撤销或改判&#10;  AUTO_RESOLVED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#10;  UPHELD --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#10;  OVERTURNED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#10;  ROOT_CAUSE_FILED --&gt; CLOSED&#10;  CLOSED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; RECEIVED\n  RECEIVED --&gt; NEEDS_INFO: 无法定位判定\n  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; RECEIVED: 申诉人补充信息\n  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; CLOSED: 超过补件期限\n  RECEIVED --&gt; TRIAGED: 定位成功 + 归类完成\n  TRIAGED --&gt; AUTO_RESOLVED: 可自动判定者\n  TRIAGED --&gt; QUEUED_MANUAL: 需语义判断\n  QUEUED_MANUAL --&gt; REVIEWING: 复核员领取\n  REVIEWING --&gt; UPHELD: 判定正确, 维持\n  REVIEWING --&gt; OVERTURNED: 判定有误, 撤销或改判\n  AUTO_RESOLVED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED\n  UPHELD --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED\n  OVERTURNED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED\n  ROOT_CAUSE_FILED --&gt; CLOSED\n  CLOSED --&gt; [*]</pre><p>状态机的价值在于两个「必须经过」的约束：所有非补件终止的路径都必须经过 <code>ROOT_CAUSE_FILED</code>（保证每条处理过的申诉都留下根因记录），以及 <code>OVERTURNED</code> 不能直接到 <code>CLOSED</code>（保证撤销动作必然触发一次规则侧的回看）。这两条如果靠流程规范约束，实际执行中一定会被跳过。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; RECEIVED&#10;  RECEIVED --&gt; NEEDS_INFO: 无法定位判定&#10;  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; RECEIVED: 申诉人补充信息&#10;  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; CLOSED: 超过补件期限&#10;  RECEIVED --&gt; TRIAGED: 定位成功 + 归类完成&#10;  TRIAGED --&gt; AUTO_RESOLVED: 可自动判定者&#10;  TRIAGED --&gt; QUEUED_MANUAL: 需语义判断&#10;  QUEUED_MANUAL --&gt; REVIEWING: 复核员领取&#10;  REVIEWING --&gt; UPHELD: 判定正确, 维持&#10;  REVIEWING --&gt; OVERTURNED: 判定有误, 撤销或改判&#10;  AUTO_RESOLVED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#10;  UPHELD --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#10;  OVERTURNED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#10;  ROOT_CAUSE_FILED --&gt; CLOSED&#10;  CLOSED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; RECEIVED\n  RECEIVED --&gt; NEEDS_INFO: 无法定位判定\n  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; RECEIVED: 申诉人补充信息\n  NEEDS_INFO --&gt; CLOSED: 超过补件期限\n  RECEIVED --&gt; TRIAGED: 定位成功 + 归类完成\n  TRIAGED --&gt; AUTO_RESOLVED: 可自动判定者\n  TRIAGED --&gt; QUEUED_MANUAL: 需语义判断\n  QUEUED_MANUAL --&gt; REVIEWING: 复核员领取\n  REVIEWING --&gt; UPHELD: 判定正确, 维持\n  REVIEWING --&gt; OVERTURNED: 判定有误, 撤销或改判\n  AUTO_RESOLVED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED\n  UPHELD --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED\n  OVERTURNED --&gt; ROOT_CAUSE_FILED\n  ROOT_CAUSE_FILED --&gt; CLOSED\n  CLOSED --&gt; [*]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE appeal_tickets (&#10;  ticket_id      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  decision_id    TEXT,&#10;  target_kind    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  target_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  scope_key      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  dispute_type   TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                 CHECK (dispute_type IN (&#39;category_wrong&#39;,&#39;license_missing&#39;,&#10;                        &#39;claim_overbroad&#39;,&#39;jurisdiction_wrong&#39;,&#10;                        &#39;content_changed&#39;,&#39;duplicate&#39;)),&#10;  state          TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;RECEIVED&#39;&#10;                 CHECK (state IN (&#39;RECEIVED&#39;,&#39;NEEDS_INFO&#39;,&#39;TRIAGED&#39;,&#10;                        &#39;AUTO_RESOLVED&#39;,&#39;QUEUED_MANUAL&#39;,&#39;REVIEWING&#39;,&#10;                        &#39;UPHELD&#39;,&#39;OVERTURNED&#39;,&#39;ROOT_CAUSE_FILED&#39;,&#39;CLOSED&#39;)),&#10;  root_cause     TEXT,&#10;  opened_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  closed_at      TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  CONSTRAINT decision_or_target CHECK (decision_id IS NOT NULL OR target_id IS NOT NULL)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> appeal_tickets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ticket_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_kind    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_key      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispute_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dispute_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'category_wrong'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'license_missing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                        'claim_overbroad'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'jurisdiction_wrong'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                        'content_changed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'duplicate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RECEIVED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RECEIVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NEEDS_INFO'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TRIAGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                        'AUTO_RESOLVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'QUEUED_MANUAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REVIEWING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                        'UPHELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OVERTURNED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ROOT_CAUSE_FILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  root_cause     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  opened_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  closed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision_or_target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>decision_or_target</code> 约束对应「一键申诉」设计：理想情况是申诉携带 <code>decision_id</code>，但总有用户从其他入口提交，此时至少要有 <code>target_id</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"争议归类-为什么要做-以及如何度量它\">争议归类：为什么要做，以及如何度量它</h3><p>不归类的申诉队列只能回答「申诉量是多少」；归类之后才能回答「误杀集中在哪」，这个区别决定了系统能否自我改进。假设某周申诉量从 500 涨到 1500：不归类时唯一的动作是加人手；归类后可能立刻看出其中 900 条是「资质确实存在但未被识别」，这说明资质数据同步出了问题而不是规则过宽——修复方向从「调阈值」变成「修数据管道」。归类必须<strong>可自动化</strong>：先用轻量分类（关键词 + 规则）给出初始归类，人工复核时确认或修正，修正后的数据成为分类器的训练信号。归类器的质量必须被度量：人工修正率应低于 15%，未归类率应低于 10%，类型分布漂移应低于 20%。未归类率最需要关注：高未归类率说明存在<strong>尚未被类型覆盖的误杀形态</strong>，而新型误杀往往正是漏放风险最高的一类，因为它是规则更新引入的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动处置的边界\">自动处置的边界</h3><p>可客观验证的类型可以走快速通道，这是把申诉处理成本从人工成本变成计算成本的关键。但自动撤销必须极其谨慎，因为它是一个<strong>放松过滤</strong>的动作，做错的后果是漏放。安全边界应满足三个条件：<strong>证据可客观验证</strong>、<strong>撤销范围最小</strong>（只撤销这一条这一作用域）、<strong>动作可逆且留痕</strong>。「内容已修改」这一类则不是撤销而是<strong>按当前内容重新判定</strong>：撤销意味着「原判定错误」，重新判定意味着「原判定针对的是另一个版本」；前者影响规则效果统计，后者不应影响。三个安全边界对应到各争议类型上的可判性并不一致，这决定了哪些类型可以进快速通道：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>争议类型</th>\n<th>证据可客观验证</th>\n<th>撤销范围是否最小</th>\n<th>是否可逆</th>\n<th>走向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资质未识别</td>\n<td>高（查资质库）</td>\n<td>是（单条单作用域）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自动撤销快速通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辖区不适用</td>\n<td>高（查作用域）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>自动撤销快速通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容已修改</td>\n<td>高（比内容哈希）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>按当前内容重新判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类判定错</td>\n<td>中（查类目映射）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>人工复核后处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复发布</td>\n<td>中（需归属判断）</td>\n<td>否（可能泛化到卖家）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>人工复核后处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文案不构成宣称</td>\n<td>低（需语义判断）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>人工复核后处置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行是唯一「客观可验证但不做撤销」的类型：它的正确处置是重新判定，因为它要纠正的不是判定逻辑而是判定对象。第五行则卡在「撤销范围最小」上——「重复发布」的处理天然涉及卖家归属，容易从单条泛化到账号级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误杀回流与重训规则\">误杀回流与重训规则</h3><p>申诉通过后的数据是两类混合：<strong>真误杀</strong>（判定确实错了，可用于改进规则）与<strong>合法豁免</strong>（判定规则本身没错，只是这一例有依据）。混在一起回流会让规则被系统性放松——因为所有申诉成功案例在数据上看起来都像「这条规则不该命中」。因此回流必须先分类，再分别进入不同的改进通道。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;feedback_channel_id&quot;: &quot;APPEAL_FEEDBACK_V2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;routes&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;signal&quot;: &quot;overturned_root_cause=category_wrong&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;taxonomy_mapping&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;fix_category_prefix&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;signal&quot;: &quot;overturned_root_cause=license_missing&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;data_pipeline&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;repair_sync&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;signal&quot;: &quot;overturned_root_cause=claim_overbroad&quot;,&#10;      &quot;target&quot;: &quot;rule_narrowing&quot;,&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;add_exclusion_or_window&quot;,&#10;      &quot;requires_shadow_eval&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;model_retrain&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;admit_labels&quot;: [&quot;overturned_root_cause=claim_overbroad&quot;],&#10;    &quot;exclude_labels&quot;: [&quot;upheld_with_exemption&quot;],&#10;    &quot;min_labels_per_rule&quot;: 30,&#10;    &quot;holdout_required&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"feedback_channel_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"APPEAL_FEEDBACK_V2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"routes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"signal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overturned_root_cause=category_wrong\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"taxonomy_mapping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fix_category_prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"signal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overturned_root_cause=license_missing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data_pipeline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"repair_sync\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"signal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overturned_root_cause=claim_overbroad\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule_narrowing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"add_exclusion_or_window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"requires_shadow_eval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"model_retrain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"admit_labels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"overturned_root_cause=claim_overbroad\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exclude_labels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"upheld_with_exemption\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_labels_per_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"holdout_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>model_retrain.admit_labels</code> 与 <code>exclude_labels</code> 这一对最关键：<strong>只有语义判定类的误杀才适合作为模型训练标签</strong>，而因资质或作用域导致的误杀是数据问题，把它们当作标签训练会让模型学到「这类内容不该拦」（错误的泛化）。<code>min_labels_per_rule</code> 是第二个保护：少数几条误杀不足以支撑一次重训，用它们训练会把噪声固化成模型行为。<code>holdout_required</code> 让重训效果可度量——没有留出集的迭代无法回答「这次重训是否让误杀下降而漏放没有上升」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"白名单-从个案豁免到结构化信任\">白名单：从个案豁免到结构化信任</h2><p>白名单是最容易被滥用的机制。它的直觉很自然：某个卖家被误杀过几次，把他加进白名单就不会再被误杀了。但这个做法的后果是灾难性的——白名单变成了绕过所有合规检查的后门。正确的白名单不是「人/卖家的豁免」，而是**「特定主张 + 特定证据 + 特定作用域 + 有效期」的结构化豁免**。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>whitelist_entry</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mtext>subject</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>exempted_rule</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>scope</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>justification</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>expiry</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{whitelist\\_entry} = \\langle \\text{subject}, \\; \\text{exempted\\_rule}, \\; \\text{scope}, \\; \\text{justification}, \\; \\text{expiry} \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">whitelist_entry</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">subject</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exempted_rule</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">justification</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">expiry</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在 <code>exempted_rule</code>：白名单必须<strong>指向具体规则</strong>，而不是全局豁免。一个持有医疗器械许可证的卖家，在「无资质销售医疗器械」这条规则上被豁免，但在「未注册保健品功效宣称」这条规则上仍受约束。这个粒度让白名单的风险面被限制在单条规则内。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE rule_exemptions (&#10;  exemption_id  TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  subject_kind  TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                CHECK (subject_kind IN (&#39;seller&#39;,&#39;doc&#39;,&#39;category&#39;,&#39;domain&#39;)),&#10;  subject_id    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  scope_keys    TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  justification TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_ref  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  granted_by    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  expires_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  review_state  TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;ACTIVE&#39;&#10;                CHECK (review_state IN (&#39;ACTIVE&#39;,&#39;EXPIRED&#39;,&#39;REVOKED&#39;,&#39;PENDING_REVIEW&#39;)),&#10;  CONSTRAINT no_permanent_exemption CHECK (expires_at &gt; granted_at)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rule_exemptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exemption_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_kind  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (subject_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'seller'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'doc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'category'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'domain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_keys    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  justification </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  granted_by    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  review_state  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACTIVE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (review_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPIRED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REVOKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING_REVIEW'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> no_permanent_exemption </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> granted_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>no_permanent_exemption</code> 可能是整张表里最有价值的一行。永久白名单是合规债务：它今天解决了一个误杀，三年后没人记得它为什么存在，而它仍在放行内容。强制有效期意味着每一条豁免都必须被周期性重新论证，且有效期长度按依据类型设定——基于法定资质的可较长（与资质有效期对齐），基于监管分类的约半年，基于个案的应很短（数周），而用于绕过数据管道缺口的「临时绕道」应最短且限制续期次数：这类豁免的存在意味着数据管道有问题，豁免只是让问题不再可见。</p>\n<h3 id=\"豁免的衰减-复核与管控\">豁免的衰减、复核与管控</h3><p>每条豁免在到期前应当进入 <code>PENDING_REVIEW</code>，复核任务附带「该豁免生效期间的放行量与其中被后续判定为违规的数量」。第二个数字是关键：放行 500 条而其中 40 条后来被判违规，说明风险实质性存在，应收紧或撤销；放行 500 条且无一条被判违规，说明依据依然成立，可以续期。</p>\n<p>这个统计要求豁免的<strong>生效范围可以被回溯计算</strong>——系统必须能回答「如果没有这条豁免，过去 30 天会有多少条被拦」。实现靠<strong>影子评估</strong>：豁免生效时判定照常执行并记录，只是结果被豁免覆盖，因此任何时候都能算出「挽回的误杀」与「放过的违规」，两边都是真实数字而非估计。计数必须落在可聚合的计数表上，并区分零曝光/低曝光，而不是去重放历史请求。复核判据是：挽回拦截数高且违规确认数低说明豁免有效、可续期；挽回拦截数高但违规确认数高说明豁免过宽、应改绑更细规则；挽回拦截数低说明豁免无实际价值、应撤销以减少合规债务；无法计算说明影子评估未接入、应视为高风险。</p>\n<p>黑名单的风险是漏放（受限于规则精度），白名单的风险是<strong>绕过全部检查</strong>，因此白名单的授予权限必须高于黑名单：黑名单可以批量自动化签发，白名单必须有人工审批且记录审批人，且<strong>撤销必须能秒级生效</strong>，与下架指令同级——当发现一条豁免被滥用时，每多一秒都在放行违规。这意味着豁免集必须与黑名单一样进入实时分发通道。豁免集在内存中可与黑名单位图对称：判定时先查黑名单再查豁免，命中豁免则恢复原规则的<strong>上一个动作档</strong>，而不恢复到 <code>pass</code>。申诉材料则是<strong>外部输入</strong>，内容不可信且常含个人信息，用途被严格限定为「给人看」，既不能作为判定输入，也不能作为训练数据；这条约束必须在数据流上物理隔离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申诉与下架的并发处理\">申诉与下架的并发处理</h3><p>申诉期间可能又收到一条更新的下架指令，或该内容被要求展示更正。直接按申诉结论释放会导致「撤销更正绑定」或「绕过后来的下架」，两者都是事故。正确处理：对目标加锁后先读取同时存在的其他指令；若结论是撤销，而目标上存在更正绑定则转人工裁决，存在更新的下架指令则拒绝释放并标记为已被取代，两者都不存在才执行释放；结论是维持则按正常路径落库。这类转人工裁决与 <a href=\"../takedown-distribution/legal-correction-notice\">法定更正与辟谣内容</a> 中「互斥组冲突必须人工裁决」是同一条原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申诉处理的时效与公平性\">申诉处理的时效与公平性</h2><p><strong>时效</strong>要求端到端时间可测量且可告警，且测量必须按阶段拆分（定位判定、归类、排队等待、复核、答复），以便找出瓶颈——瓶颈在排队等待就加人手，在定位判定就改进判定通知的设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"sla-分级与触发判据\">SLA 分级与触发判据</h3><p>分级的依据是<strong>申诉主张所涉权利的性质与救济的紧迫性</strong>，而不是提交的时间顺序。分级必须由系统判定而不是由申诉人自选——后者会导致所有申诉都声称自己是 P0；合理做法是用 <code>dispute_type</code>、<code>target_category</code> 与判定的 <code>legal_basis</code> 组合出等级，并把依据写入工单，让申诉人可以质疑等级而不需要重新提交。四级的触发条件与时限是：P0（涉及基本权利或法定期限临近）首次答复 4 小时、最终 24 小时，超时升级到法务并留痕；P1（高争议品类如医疗、金融、未成年）首次 24 小时、最终 3 天，超时升级到合规值守；P2（常规受限品类）首次 48 小时、最终 7 天，超时计入周度报告；P3（低风险质量问题）首次 5 天、最终 15 天，超时计入月度统计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公平性与一致性度量\">公平性与一致性度量</h3><p><strong>公平性</strong>要求相似申诉得到相似结论，这在人工复核下是真实的偏差来源。缓解手段是<strong>复核判据的结构化</strong>（对每类争议给出明确判定标准与示例）与<strong>先例库</strong>（让后续相似案件参考已有结论）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>处理时延</mtext><mrow><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>locate</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>classify</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>review</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>reply</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{处理时延}_{P95} = t_{\\text{locate}} + t_{\\text{classify}} + t_{\\text{queue}} + t_{\\text{review}} + t_{\\text{reply}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">处理时延</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">locate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">classify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">review</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reply</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>一致性</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>同类型同证据情形的裁决中，与主流结论一致的数量</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>该情形总数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{一致性} = \\frac{|\\{\\text{同类型同证据情形的裁决中，与主流结论一致的数量}\\}|}{|\\{\\text{该情形总数}\\}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一致性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该情形总数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同类型同证据情形的裁决中，与主流结论一致的数量</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一致性的度量要求系统能识别「同类型同证据情形」，这又回到结构化争议类型与结构化证据的价值：只有结构化的输入才能做相似度计算。先例库必须记录「为什么这样判」而不只是「判了什么」，且先例要有有效期与复核期限——规则会变，先例结论在规则变更后可能不再成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申诉数据反哺规则\">申诉数据反哺规则</h2><p>闭环的四个环节是<strong>归类统计</strong>（找出高误杀的规则与争议类型）、<strong>根因定位</strong>（区分规则过宽、数据缺失还是作用域错误）、<strong>修复动作</strong>、<strong>效果验证</strong>。每类根因的修复动作与过度信号分别是：规则过宽需收紧邻近窗口或补排除标签，过度信号是该规则拦截量骤降；数据缺失需修复同步管道或补录，过度信号是未识别的违规出现；作用域错误需修正作用域键，过度信号是其他辖区出现漏放；时效错误需按当前哈希判定，过度信号是旧版本内容重新违规；词表歧义需拆分标签或细化模式，过度信号是召回率下降。</p>\n<p>最后一项（修复过度的信号）是很多团队遗漏的：所有修复都可能矫枉过正，因此每次修复都必须同时定义「什么情况下说明修过头了」，并在观察期内同时监控两个方向的指标。效果验证的判据是一对双向条件：<strong>申诉率必须显著下降，而拦截量的下降幅度必须小于它</strong>——只满足前一半说明修复可能过度；只满足后一半说明减少的拦截量与误杀无关。低命中量规则的指标噪声大，因此还需一个「样本不足，延长观察窗口」的结论分支，把噪声判成效果会让规则质量评估整体失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>申诉同时是救济通道、误杀率仪表与规则改进的数据源；争议类型必须结构化归类，它决定了修复方向是调阈值还是修数据，未归类率是发现新型误杀的信号。</li>\n<li>只有证据可客观验证、范围最小、可逆留痕的争议类型才允许自动处置；「内容已修改」应按新内容重新判定而不是撤销。</li>\n<li>白名单必须是「主体 + 具体规则 + 作用域 + 依据 + 有效期」的结构化豁免，永久豁免必须被数据库约束禁止；有效期按依据类型分级。</li>\n<li>豁免生效期间应做影子评估，以便复核时同时看到「挽回的误杀」与「放过的违规」两个数字。</li>\n<li>申诉材料是不可信外部输入，必须在数据流上物理隔离，既不进判定链路也不进训练数据。</li>\n<li>白名单的授予权限高于黑名单，且撤销必须进入秒级实时通道；豁免恢复动作时不应恢复到 <code>pass</code>。</li>\n<li>申诉闭环必须包含效果验证环节，且每次修复都要同时定义「修过头的信号」，同时监控申诉率与拦截量两个方向。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>申诉与内部纠错之外，还有一类对外义务是主动向监管报送并配合调查，它的数据组织方式与查询模式都不同，见 <a href=\"regulator-report-cooperation\">监管报送与配合调查</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"误杀申诉与白名单","id":"误杀申诉与白名单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：申诉是三种信息的汇聚点","id":"核心概念-申诉是三种信息的汇聚点"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉工单的状态机","id":"申诉工单的状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"争议归类：为什么要做，以及如何度量它","id":"争议归类-为什么要做-以及如何度量它"},{"level":3,"text":"自动处置的边界","id":"自动处置的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"误杀回流与重训规则","id":"误杀回流与重训规则"},{"level":2,"text":"白名单：从个案豁免到结构化信任","id":"白名单-从个案豁免到结构化信任"},{"level":3,"text":"豁免的衰减、复核与管控","id":"豁免的衰减-复核与管控"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉与下架的并发处理","id":"申诉与下架的并发处理"},{"level":2,"text":"申诉处理的时效与公平性","id":"申诉处理的时效与公平性"},{"level":3,"text":"SLA 分级与触发判据","id":"sla-分级与触发判据"},{"level":3,"text":"公平性与一致性度量","id":"公平性与一致性度量"},{"level":2,"text":"申诉数据反哺规则","id":"申诉数据反哺规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"过滤判定证据链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/evidence-appeal-report/decision-evidence-chain"},"next":{"title":"监管报送与配合调查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/evidence-appeal-report/regulator-report-cooperation"}}